Syntax: mindfocus

Mind focus allows a psionicist to enter a deep meditative state, turning
their mental energies inward to accelerate the regeneration of their
psionic reserves. During this focused state, the mind repairs and
rejuvenates itself far more quickly than through normal rest.

When the command is activated, the psionicist begins the focusing process.
Success requires a clear mind and sufficient mental energy to initiate
the trance state. Once established, the focus persists for a period of
time, providing enhanced mana regeneration throughout its duration.

While focusing the mind, all other psionic powers become unavailable.
The intense inward concentration required precludes any outward projection
of mental force. Telepathy, psychic attacks, and telekinetic abilities
all become inaccessible until the focusing state ends naturally or is
otherwise interrupted.

This limitation makes mind focus a strategic choice - the psionicist must
decide when to withdraw from active use of their powers in order to
recover them more quickly. It is particularly useful during periods of
rest between confrontations, but dangerous to initiate while threats
remain nearby.

Failing to properly establish the focus wastes the initial mana investment
but allows immediate use of other powers.

